{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33948","headline":"鲁望以躬掇野蔬兼示雅什用以詶谢 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望以躬掇野蔬兼示雅什用以詶谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杖擿春烟暖向阳，烦君爲我致盈筐。\n深挑乍见牛唇液，细掐徐闻鼠耳香。\n紫甲采从泉脉畔，翠牙搜自石根傍。\n雕胡饭熟𩝊餬软，不是高人不合尝","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}